---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Connect — Philly" description="Connect Philly to a local MCP client.">
  <h1>Connect Philly</h1>
  <p><small>Node 24+ required. Hosted MCP is not live.</small></p>
  <h2>Install</h2>
  <figure><button data-copy aria-label="Copy server installation">Copy</button><pre><code>git clone https://github.com/h0rv/philly.git
cd philly/mcp
npm ci</code></pre></figure>
  <h2>Connect</h2>
  <p>Replace <code>/absolute/path/to/philly</code> with your checkout’s path.</p>
  <details open>
    <summary>Claude Code</summary>
    <figure><button data-copy aria-label="Copy Claude Code setup">Copy</button><pre><code>claude mcp add philly -- node --experimental-strip-types /absolute/path/to/philly/mcp/src/stdio.ts</code></pre></figure>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary>Desktop clients</summary>
    <figure><button data-copy aria-label="Copy stdio client configuration">Copy</button><pre><code>{JSON.stringify({mcpServers:{philly:{command:'node',args:['--experimental-strip-types','/absolute/path/to/philly/mcp/src/stdio.ts']}}},null,2)}</code></pre></figure>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary>VS Code</summary>
    <p>Add to <code>.vscode/mcp.json</code>:</p>
    <figure><button data-copy aria-label="Copy VS Code configuration">Copy</button><pre><code>{JSON.stringify({servers:{philly:{type:'stdio',command:'node',args:['--experimental-strip-types','/absolute/path/to/philly/mcp/src/stdio.ts']}}},null,2)}</code></pre></figure>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary>Local HTTP</summary>
    <p>From the repository root:</p>
    <figure><button data-copy aria-label="Copy local HTTP setup">Copy</button><pre><code>cd website
bun install --frozen-lockfile
bun run build
cd ../mcp
npm run dev</code></pre></figure>
    <figure><button data-copy aria-label="Copy local MCP URL">Copy</button><pre><code>http://127.0.0.1:8787/mcp</code></pre></figure>
    <small>For clients on your computer. Cloud-hosted assistants cannot reach localhost.</small>
  </details>
  <p><a href="https://github.com/h0rv/philly/blob/main/mcp/README.md">MCP tools and limits</a></p>
  <p role="status" aria-live="polite" data-copy-status></p>
</BaseLayout>
<script>import '../../scripts/interactions';</script>
